1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,599
I can't believe none of us knew that!

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,004
Is that... Jesus?!

3
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:14,139
Who fell asleep during Paul's sermon
and fell from a third-story window?

4
00:00:18,139 --> 00:00:24,670
Hints: Acts. A very long sermon. An open window.

5
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:25,841
Last chance?

6
00:00:27,841 --> 00:00:28,993
We give up.

7
00:00:34,911 --> 00:00:36,949
You have to read your Bible.

8
00:00:38,949 --> 00:00:40,516
To know your Bible.

9
00:00:40,611 --> 00:00:41,486
Play Manna.

10
00:00:41,611 --> 00:00:43,595
40,000 Bible questions.

11
00:00:43,711 --> 00:00:45,290
Play alone or with friends.

12
